<title>USA: TABLE - UroHealth year shr loss widens.</title>
<headline>TABLE - UroHealth year shr loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT BEACH, Calif. 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $4.59     loss	 $2.03</p>
<p> Net loss		  89,177     loss	30,199</p>
<p> Net sales		 90,695		   56,630</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  19,419		   14,881</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Above figures are for 12 months ended March 31.</p>
<p>The company said its results reflect several acquisitions, financing and inventory charges totaling $73.7 million as compared with similar charges of $13.2 million in the prior year.</p>
<p>UroHealth Systems Inc.</p>
</text>
